title: cursor:next
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Generic panel commands]]
kind: reference
summary: Move a panel's cursor down one row (self / a panel type)

Moves the cursor of a panel down one row: of the focused panel with `self`, of the panel type named otherwise ([[Generic panel commands]]). On the last row a paged list has loaded — the [[metarecord-list panel]] — it loads the next page first, so a script or a key reaches every match, even while the panel is not on screen. With no row under the cursor, it lands on the first.
